  "name": "In-app purchases, ratings and widgets of iPhone step counters",
  "description": "A hand-made survey of iPhone step counter apps on the US App Store. In-app purchase prices were read off each app's own store page, because Apple's search interface does not report them. Ratings, widget mentions and last-updated months come from the same listings. No app was ranked or scored; this is what the store showed on the date below.",
